        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, it's real hard getting an audience with you these days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am truly sorry I was unable to attend the Matriarch's funeral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Sciurus, I am deeply saddened by what has befallen the Browntail clan. Please let me know if there is anything Clan Silverash can do to help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's not what I came here to discuss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your visit this time, Madam Sciurus, must be to give me a chance to earn your trust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... My sister once told me that you're least trustworthy when you lower your head like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wonder about your opinion of me, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to beat around the bush. I don't like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sister used to scold me for being impulsive, and for not always thinking things through before I speak or act.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to prove to her that I didn't need to hide under her wing, that I could do something for Clan Browntail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, as new matriarch of the clan, there is no one left for me to prove anything to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand how you feel. I... also have two younger sisters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you think they're both smarter than me, huh? Both Ensia, and the Saintess...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think too little of yourself, Madam Sciurus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I do think they share your persistence and determination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Ensia okay? I heard... she was in an accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your concern. She is safe and sound, and has already returned home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You always keep that calm and composed demeanor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I want to know is... these attacks on Kjerag, including what happened to my sister... Did you know about them ahead of time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is the real reason you decided to visit me today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enciodes, my sister had been helping you this entire time, isn't that right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't totally in the dark about it, but it wasn't until her passing that I learned...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your plans\u2014for Victoria, Rhine Lab, and what Monch has been investigating... There's too much I don't know anything about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't try to deny it. Don't lie to me, Enciodes. You have to know the truth behind her murder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you truly believe I had a hand in the Matriarch's death\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... That's not what I mean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what Ratatos was plotting with you, but I know for sure... that whatever it was, it was to protect Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... I will follow in her footsteps... Whatever Clan Browntail's affairs may be, I will take responsibility for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is why... I need you to tell me exactly what happened to her\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My apologies, Sir Enciodes, but they were determined to break in no matter what\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silverash Clan Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To what do I owe the honor, for you all to barge into my home like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir Enciodes, why did Karlan Trade transfer all its shares in the Kjerag-Kazimierz joint mining operation to Victoria without authorization?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did this news come from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is an observable fact\u2014the mines have completely been taken over by the Victorians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Great Elder Adso believes that such actions by Karlan Trade constitute illegal collusion with a foreign power, and as such, the Vine-Bead Court has no choice but to exercise its authority to intervene.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "We require that you report to the Vine-Bead Court immediately to explain yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I understand this correctly, the Vine-Bead Court means to formally interrogate Clan Silverash?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people of Kjerag are uneasy enough as it is. The last thing we want is to see this conflict escalate further.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, Sir Enciodes, as the head of the clan, if you still believe you bear responsibility for Kjerag, please go to the Vine-Bead Court with us to discuss the next steps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. I have no reason to refuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, if I am to explain the situation, I will need some time to prepare the relevant documents. Please allow me that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, I still have some things to discuss with Madam Sciurus, so I would like to ask for your patience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Sciurus, thank you for taking the time to look after Ensia. I would like to formally invite you to be a guest of Clan Silverash.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would also like to thank you for your concern in person, while Ensia is present as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would have been more courteous to have sent the invitation to you in a formal capacity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But given the hasty nature of this matter, the best I can do is to throw something together by hand. I do hope you'll forgive me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "We look forward to you gracing us with your presence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Before his 'invitee' can respond, Enciodes picks up a pen and paper from the table, scribbles down a few lines, then hands the 'invitation' over."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus takes it. There is only an address on the piece of paper, hardly an invitation at all."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for the invitation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be there on time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
