    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "To Mr. Edelweiss of Karlan Trade:",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nI hope this letter finds you well.",
        "x": 380,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nAt the time you are read this, I am yet to receive sitrep authorization from Rhine Lab, so please take note\u2014",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nThis letter does not, in any capacity, serve as an agreement or treaty between Rhine Lab and Karlan Trade. Rather, it only represents my personal analysis of the recent phenomena in Kjerag.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nMy specimen comes from the sound waves collected by the observation station at 3:19 AM on December 7, 1101.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "I can say for certain that at that time, an unidentified object fell from the sky onto Mount Karlan.",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nThough the chain of evidence definitively linking the phenomena is still missing, a Catastrophe did in fact occur 32 hours later.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nI do not intend to establish a causal link between these two things. If this crash is a singular event in history, then so too is the Catastrophe.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "What I AM preparing to do is to confirm whether or not there is an empirical connection between these two events.",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nAdditionally, do forgive my frankness, but if the hypothesis that these two events are linked does bear out, the outcome for Kjerag is not optimistic\u2014",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nWhatever factor that has protected Kjerag from Catastrophes over the millennia may no longer be effective, or at least, be in an unusable state.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "I would, of course, love to write this off as mere conjecture. But nevertheless, I also hope that Karlan Trade will be adequately mindful of the potential risks moving forward.",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nCarolin, an insider with more detailed information, has likely made similar inferences, but I am in the dark as to what her objectives are at this moment.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\nI will strive to complete this research while maintaining an objective and rational perspective, and would greatly appreciate Karlan Trade's support in my efforts.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n\\n\\nRespectfully, Elena Urbica.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1162_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I was just looking for you, Director.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Karlan Trade Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take this letter over to Enciodes. Classify it top secret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1162_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir. Right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Karlan Trade Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any other news?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1162_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes\u2014the observation post previously dispatched to the mining site has sent back a sighting report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Karlan Trade Employee"
    },
    {
        "text": "A convoy bearing Victorian markings is approaching the outskirts of the mine, but the specific origins are unknown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Karlan Trade Employee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Matterhorn led his clansmen there ahead of time. He said that he would try to stall for as much time as possible and await your judgment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Karlan Trade Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Victorians would've come sooner or later. Looks like we won't have to wait any longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prepare vehicles as soon as possible. Matterhorn may not be able to hold them off for long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell him to let the other party make the first move, and prioritize observation. I will arrive shortly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "67_G14_miningarea",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm warning you, don't get in our way, if you know what's good for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am simply following orders. The area ahead is a restricted warehouse, and nobody is allowed to enter without Karlan Trade's permission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has no one informed you that House Caster has acquired all of Kazimierz's rights to this site?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To the best of my knowledge, the handover process is still underway. We were only notified by Kazimierz yesterday.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is why we have to inspect all the assets in advance. If you have an complaints, you can take them up with Her Grace the Duke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, listen to your betters and open the warehouse door post-haste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, someone worth talking to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Gnosis Edelweiss of Karlan Trade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems the introduction I've prepared will be going to waste, good sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. Naturally, you also understand who I'm representing here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Due to your mismanagement and the resultant substantial financial losses, Her Grace the Duke has decided to dismiss some key employees of Karlan Trade employed at this site, including the former executive manager.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To this, I have no objection. I will cooperate fully during this handover process.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent. Now then, Mr. Edelweiss, please open the warehouse door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...However, on this point alone, I cannot comply.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "What Matterhorn said is true. There indeed are regulations pertaining to this confidential warehouse. I humbly ask for yours and Her Grace's understanding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on the information I have, the security clearance level on this warehouse was raised just recently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you say to this, Mr. Edelweiss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allow me to explain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "This warehouse is mainly used to store various kinds of industrial waste, but recently, the purification system and negative pressure ventilation system both malfunctioned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "We temporarily raised the security clearance level and strictly restricted access in the interim before professionals can handle the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I fully understand Her Grace's concern about the assets acquired, but for your safety, could I ask that this inspection be postponed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I accept the risks at hand. Just open the door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All else aside, this is Kjerag's mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should pollutants leak, or any other dangerous situation arises, Kjerag does not rule out the right to intervene through administrative measures.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before you offer to take responsibility, I suggest you contact Her Grace the Duke once more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good to see you again, Mr. Matterhorn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pardon me, Father. I'm afraid I'll have to ask you to wait at reception for now. I currently have business with our diplomatic guest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Edelweiss, I was expressly invited here by the Victorians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since when is the Vine-Bead Court so concerned with temporal affairs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today, both the clan leadership and the general public are dissatisfied with the way Karlan Trade has been engaging with Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Elder has summoned Sir Enciodes to an inquiry into the matter; perhaps, you will also need to report to the Vine-Bead Court soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why, then, would a cleric feel a need to accept an invitation to come here before that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish to ensure a smooth handover process, and hope that Karlan Trade is willing to cooperate to the fullest extent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please open the warehouse door, Mr. Edelweiss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Given that power has been restored by the three clans, perhaps the Vine-Bead Court would be more representative of Kjerag's 'administrative measures'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Matterhorn, open the door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "150,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_dooropen",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The door slowly opens, and the Victorian ambassador is caught unaware by the dust that diffuses from within. He squints and fans the air in front of him with his hand."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is neither the smell of industrial waste nor the texture of Originium dust. The ambassador's eyes gradually adjust to the vast, unobstructed warehouse, within which is\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nothing but scrap metal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I stated, there is nothing here but industrial waste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please leave as soon as you've finished your inspection. Staying here for an extended period of time would be detrimental to your health.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, stay put. I'm conducting the inspection myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "150,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": false,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_warehouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": true,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "As soon as he enters the warehouse, he feels the vast space around him dilating in all directions, the steel frames stretching straight to the ceiling surrounded by scrap metal of all shapes and sizes."
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way such a large warehouse was set up just to store these things. It's far too pretentious."
    },
    {
        "text": "He approaches the bottom of one of the shelves and reaches out to rummage through it with no particular aim in mind. The clanging of metal echoes through the warehouse."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed voice) Wait, this is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed voice) It's still half-intact, and I can still make out the insignia of Silverash's private army, the 'Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4'. Were these originally weapons and gear not improperly disposed of after being thrown in the shredder...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#7$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "An idea bubbles up, and he keeps looking elsewhere. Though Karlan Trade has been quite meticulous, a few clues are bound to leak through. Of this, he is certain."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed voice) Replicas of Victoria's newest equipment, as well as large-caliber naval gun parts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed voice) All failures, unable to break through the technical barrier...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "The army designations. The insignias. Many other terms in the Kjeragi language. He quietly memorizes them all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir! Are you done yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes, I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
