    },
    {
        "text": "The ambassador returns to the group."
    },
    {
        "text": "I've more or less seen what I needed to see, Mr. Edelweiss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will summarize the entire situation and faithfully report it to the Duke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, the internal railway in the mining site has just been cleared, and you haven't had time to inspect it yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does Victoria also need to use that internal railway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2012_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, we've contacted a number of suppliers for quotes. Using the internal railway can significantly reduce transportation costs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Father, is the Vine-Bead Court aware of this? If you are so keen to get involved in diplomatic affairs, Karlan Trade hopes that you will also be willing to verify any business entities that wish to join.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gnosis's concern interrupts the thoughts of the Vine-Bead Court envoy, who then looks away from the railway."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That would require the Great Elder's input.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr, I ask that the Vine-Bead Court not make things difficult for Enciodes. I will remain at Karlan Trade's headquarters, awaiting your summons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_268",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vine-Bead Court Envoy"
    },
